  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IntelligenceModding/Artemis-Texture-Packs/refs/heads/assets/overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"315\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Этот ресурспак заменяет все мечи различными световыми мечами.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IntelligenceModding/Artemis-Texture-Packs/refs/heads/assets/images.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"315\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IntelligenceModding/Artemis-Texture-Packs/refs/heads/assets/swords_to_lightsabers/image_8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IntelligenceModding/Artemis-Texture-Packs/refs/heads/assets/swords_to_lightsabers/image_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"960\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IntelligenceModding/Artemis-Texture-Packs/refs/heads/assets/discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"315\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Также существует сервер Discord для отзывов и участия в сообществе <em>INTELLIGENCE</em>. </span><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Присоединяйтесь, используя ссылку ниже.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io